# Flashback {4}{B}: the spell is cast from a graveyard, so after Bot2 exiles a card from hand Bot1 draws a card, and the
# Negotiation itself is exiled as it leaves the stack (CR 702.34a) instead of returning to the graveyard. It was first cast
# from the hand on turn 1 (no draw; Bot2 exiles Forest), then flashed back on turn 3 with the Swamps and three Moxes
# (Bot2 exiles Island). Bot1 hand: 7 - Swamp, Negotiation, 3 Moxes = 2, plus the turn-3 draw, minus the second Swamp
# played, plus the flashback draw = 3 (without the flashback draw it would be 2).

